{%- comment -%}
  pdp5 — badan PDP kapsul dari Figma "390w light" (node 2920:5629), dari kartu
  testimoni di bawah tombol beli sampai logo "as seen in". Semua ukuran =
  koordinat Figma ÷ 3,0128 (frame 1175 = layar 390).

  Hero, pemilih paket, FAQ dan ulasan TIDAK di sini: section pdp4 yang sudah
  ada tetap dipakai (logika beli, hadiah, varian) dan hanya ditata ulang lewat
  assets/pdp5.css. JS-nya hanya karosel testimoni, tombol sertifikasi, dan
  sekuens foto "Our process".

  Semua teks (termasuk isi accordion) di locale `pdp5.story.*` (EN + ID, copy
  dari frame Figma PDP OMC EN 2920:5629 dan PDP OMC ID 2927:8404).

  Tata letak dikunci di lebar 390 lalu di-zoom ke lebar layar (--p5-z diisi
  skrip kecil di bawah), sama seperti sections/cl-all.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign p5_on = false
  if section.settings.handles == blank
    assign p5_on = true
  else
    assign p5_needle = product.handle | prepend: ',' | append: ','
    assign p5_hay = section.settings.handles | remove: ' ' | prepend: ',' | append: ','
    if p5_hay contains p5_needle
      assign p5_on = true
    endif
  endif
-%}
{%- if p5_on -%}
{%- liquid
  assign reviews = product.metafields.pdp3.reviews.value
  assign star_src = 'pdp5-stars.svg' | asset_url
-%}
<div class="p5s" data-p5s>
  <script>
    (function (el) {
      function z() {
        var w = document.documentElement.clientWidth;
        el.style.setProperty('--p5-z', (w < 960 ? Math.min(Math.max(w / 390, 0.8), 1.25) : 1).toFixed(4));
      }
      z();
      window.addEventListener('resize', z);
    })(document.currentScript.parentNode);
  </script>

  {%- comment -%}
    Testimoni (Figma "Review carousel (auto)"): satu kartu selebar kolom, tanpa intipan kartu berikut. Track scroll-snap
    native — di ponsel kartu mengikuti jari saat di-drag; di desktop drag mouse lewat JS. Titik persis Figma (bulat 7 px,
    jarak 2 px, aktif terisi), berupa tombol. Kutipan dari locale, foto & nama dari pdp3.reviews.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-rev">
    <div class="p5s-rev__show" data-p5s-show role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="{{ 'pdp5.story.reviews.verified' | t | escape }} reviews">
      <div class="p5s-rev__track" data-p5s-track>
      {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
        {%- assign r_key = 'pdp5.story.reviews.r' | append: i -%}
        {%- assign r_name = r_key | append: '.name' | t -%}
        {%- assign r_photo = '' -%}
        {%- for r in reviews -%}
          {%- assign r_first = r.name | split: ',' | first | strip -%}
          {%- if r_first == r_name -%}{%- assign r_photo = r.photo -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        <figure class="p5s-rev__card" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="{{ i }} / 5">
          {%- if r_photo != blank -%}<img class="p5s-rev__photo" src="{{ r_photo | split: '?' | first }}?width=244" alt="" width="81" height="81" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
          <figcaption class="p5s-rev__head">
            <span class="p5s-rev__name">{{ r_name }}</span>
            <span class="p5s-rev__check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="8" fill="#213d29"/><path d="M4.6 8.2l2.2 2.1 4.6-4.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
            <span class="p5s-rev__verified">{{ 'pdp5.story.reviews.verified' | t }}</span>
            <img class="p5s-rev__stars" src="{{ star_src }}" alt="5/5" width="57" height="12">
          </figcaption>
          <blockquote class="p5s-rev__quote">{{ r_key | append: '.quote' | t }}</blockquote>
        </figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <div class="p5s-rev__dots">
        {%- for d in (1..5) -%}
          <button type="button" class="p5s-rev__dot{% if d == 1 %} is-on{% endif %}" aria-label="{{ d }} / 5"{% if d == 1 %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}></button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Accordion produk (Figma "PDP Accordion", isi = panel samping 2920:6663 EN / 2932:9434 ID). Isinya dari locale,
    bukan metafield custom.product_detail: metafield itu dipakai PDP live dan copy-nya berbeda dari desain ini.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-acc-wrap">
    <div class="p5s-acc">
      {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
        {%- assign a_key = 'pdp5.story.accordion.a' | append: i -%}
        <details class="p5s-acc__item"{% if i == 4 %} id="p5-quality"{% endif %}>
          <summary><span>{{ a_key | t }}</span><img src="{{ 'pdp5-plus.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="12" height="12"></summary>
          <div class="p5s-acc__body">{{ 'pdp5.story.accordion.b' | append: i | append: '_html' | t }}</div>
        </details>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} What to expect (Figma Frame 26 + timeline). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-head p5s-head--expect">
    <p class="p5s-eyebrow">{{ 'pdp5.story.expect.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
    <h2 class="p5s-h2">{{ 'pdp5.story.expect.heading_html' | t }}</h2>
    <p class="p5s-lead">{{ 'pdp5.story.expect.body' | t }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-tl-wrap">
    <ol class="p5s-tl">
      {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
        {%- assign t_key = 'pdp5.story.expect.t' | append: i -%}
        <li class="p5s-tl__item p5s-tl__item--{{ i }}">
          <h3 class="p5s-tl__title">{{ t_key | append: '.title' | t }}</h3>
          <span class="p5s-tl__pill">{{ t_key | append: '.when' | t }}</span>
          <p class="p5s-tl__desc">{{ t_key | append: '.desc_html' | t }}</p>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
    <p class="p5s-tl__note">{{ 'pdp5.story.expect.note_html' | t }}</p>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} How it works (Figma Frame 33, diagram Frame 5, kartu Frame 30/43/44). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-head p5s-head--how">
    <p class="p5s-eyebrow">{{ 'pdp5.story.how.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
    <h2 class="p5s-h2">{{ 'pdp5.story.how.heading_html' | t }}</h2>
    <p class="p5s-lead">{{ 'pdp5.story.how.body_html' | t }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-diagram">
    <img src="{{ 'pdp5-diagram.png' | file_url }}" alt="{{ 'pdp5.story.how.diagram_alt' | t | escape }}" width="390" height="289" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
    {%- assign c_key = 'pdp5.story.how.c' | append: i -%}
    <div class="p5s-z p5s-card-wrap p5s-card-wrap--{{ i }}">
      <div class="p5s-card">
        <p class="p5s-eyebrow">{{ c_key | append: '.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
        <h3 class="p5s-card__title">{{ c_key | append: '.title' | t }}</h3>
        <p class="p5s-card__body">{{ c_key | append: '.body_html' | t }}</p>
        <p class="p5s-card__pills"><span>{{ c_key | append: '.pill1' | t }}</span><span>{{ c_key | append: '.pill2' | t }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Why Treelogy + tabel (Figma Frame 29 + Table). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-why">
    <p class="p5s-eyebrow">{{ 'pdp5.story.why.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
    <h2 class="p5s-h2">{{ 'pdp5.story.why.heading_html' | t }}</h2>
    <img class="p5s-why__hand" src="{{ 'pdp5-hand.png' | file_url }}" alt="" width="159" height="126" loading="lazy">
    <p class="p5s-lead">{{ 'pdp5.story.why.body_html' | t }}</p>
    {%- comment -%}
      Tanpa cert_url: tombol membuka dialog registrasi BPOM yang SAMA dengan PDP live (#pdp4-bpom-modal, dirender di
      bawah). Buka/tutup, klik latar, Escape, dan fokus diurus initModal() di assets/pdp4.js — tidak ada JS baru.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if section.settings.cert_url != blank -%}
      <a class="p5s-btn" href="{{ section.settings.cert_url }}">{{ 'pdp5.story.why.cta' | t }}</a>
    {%- else -%}
      <button class="p5s-btn" id="pdp4-bpom-btn" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog">{{ 'pdp5.story.why.cta' | t }}</button>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-table-wrap">
    <table class="p5s-table">
      <thead><tr><th></th><th>Treelogy</th><th>{{ 'pdp5.story.table.others' | t }}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
          {%- assign r_key = 'pdp5.story.table.r' | append: i -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">{{ r_key | append: '.label' | t }}</th><td>{{ r_key | append: '.ours' | t }}</td><td>{{ r_key | append: '.theirs' | t }}</td></tr>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Our process + karosel foto (Figma Background 2920:6125). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-proc">
    <p class="p5s-eyebrow">{{ 'pdp5.story.process.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
    <h2 class="p5s-h2 p5s-h2--light">{{ 'pdp5.story.process.heading_html' | t }}</h2>
    <p class="p5s-lead">{{ 'pdp5.story.process.body' | t }}</p>
    <a class="p5s-btn" href="{{ section.settings.farm_url | default: '/pages/farm' }}">{{ 'pdp5.story.process.cta' | t }}</a>
    <div class="p5s-proc__track">
      {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
        {%- assign s_key = 'pdp5.story.process.s' | append: i -%}
        <figure class="p5s-proc__slide">
          {%- comment -%}
            Figma menaruh GIF di sini (6–7 frame, 1 dtk/frame, 330 px, 256 warna). Frame sumbernya diunggah terpisah
            (pdp5-proc-<langkah>-<frame>.jpg) dan diputar sebagai sekuens: tajam di layar retina, WebP/AVIF dari CDN,
            dan berhenti saat tidak terlihat. Frame yang tidak ada di Files dilewati.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="p5s-proc__media" data-p5s-seq>
            {%- for f in (1..8) -%}
              {%- assign f_name = 'pdp5-proc-' | append: i | append: '-' | append: f | append: '.jpg' -%}
              {%- assign f_img = images[f_name] -%}
              {%- if f_img != blank -%}
                {%- if f == 1 -%}{%- assign f_class = 'is-on' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign f_class = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
                {{ f_img | image_url: width: 660 | image_tag: widths: '330, 495, 660, 990', sizes: '330px', loading: 'lazy', alt: '', class: f_class }}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>{{ s_key | append: '.title' | t }}</strong>{{ s_key | append: '.body' | t }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} As seen in (Figma "as seen in"). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p5s-z p5s-press">
    <p class="p5s-press__title">{{ 'pdp5.story.press' | t }}</p>
    <div class="p5s-press__logos">
      <img src="{{ 'pdp5-logo-jp.png' | file_url }}" alt="The Jakarta Post" width="135" height="16" loading="lazy">
      <img src="{{ 'pdp5-logo-bisnis.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Bisnis Indonesia" width="86" height="20" loading="lazy">
      <img src="{{ 'pdp5-logo-mi.png' | file_url }}" alt="Media Indonesia" width="103" height="32" loading="lazy">
      <img src="{{ 'pdp5-logo-now.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="NOW! Bali" width="60" height="22" loading="lazy">
      <img src="{{ 'pdp5-logo-punch.png' | file_url }}" alt="The Punch" width="111" height="14" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Dialog registrasi BPOM — markup, isi (locale pdp3.why.modal_*, baris "Label|Nilai") dan gaya (.pdp-modal di
  pdp4.css) sama dengan section pdp4-why di live. Dibungkus .pdp4-page.sk-root agar token sk-* berlaku, dan di luar
  .p5s-z supaya position:fixed tidak ikut zoom. pdp4-why di template draft nonaktif, jadi id-nya tidak bentrok.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if section.settings.cert_url == blank -%}
  {%- assign m_close = 'pdp3.why.modal_close' | t -%}
  <div class="pdp4-page sk-root">
    <div class="pdp-modal p5-cert" id="pdp4-bpom-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="pdp4-bpom-title">
      <div class="p5-cert__sheet">
        <span class="p5-cert__grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <button class="p5-cert__x" type="button" data-p5-cert-x aria-label="{{ m_close | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        <div class="p5-cert__badges" aria-hidden="true">
          <span><img src="{{ 'pdp3-cert-bpom.png' | file_url }}" alt="" width="188" height="164" loading="lazy"></span>
          <span><img src="{{ 'pdp3-cert-halal.png' | file_url }}" alt="" width="92" height="164" loading="lazy"></span>
          <span><img src="{{ 'pdp3-cert-usda.png' | file_url }}" alt="" width="144" height="144" loading="lazy"></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="p5-cert__title" id="pdp4-bpom-title">{{ 'pdp3.why.modal_heading' | t }}</h3>
        <dl class="p5-cert__list">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            {%- assign m_key = 'pdp3.why.modal_row_' | append: i -%}
            {%- assign m_row = m_key | t -%}
            {%- if m_row contains 'Translation missing' or m_row == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign m_parts = m_row | split: '|' -%}
            <div class="p5-cert__row">{% if m_parts.size > 1 %}<dt>{{ m_parts[0] | strip }}</dt><dd>{{ m_parts[1] | strip }}</dd>{% else %}<dd>{{ m_row }}</dd>{% endif %}</div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </dl>
        <button class="p5-cert__close" id="pdp4-bpom-close" type="button">{{ m_close }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

<style>
  .p5s{--p5-ink:#213d29;--p5-sec:#536c3c;--p5-card:#eef2e6;--p5-line:rgba(33,61,41,.1);background:#f8f8f2;color:var(--p5-ink);font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-optical-sizing:none;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;overflow:hidden}
  .p5s *,.p5s *::before,.p5s *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  .p5s :where(p,h2,h3,ol,ul,li,figure,blockquote,table){margin:0;padding:0}
  .p5s ol,.p5s ul{list-style:none}
  /* Ponsel: tiap blok dikunci 390 px lalu di-zoom. Desktop (≥960): kolom 720 px di tengah seperti section pdp4, tanpa zoom. */
  .p5s-z{width:390px;margin:0 auto;zoom:var(--p5-z,1);position:relative}

  .p5s-eyebrow{font-size:12px;line-height:13.2px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.24px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--p5-sec)}
  .p5s-h2{font-size:30px;line-height:36px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.36px;color:var(--p5-ink)}
  .p5s-h2--light{font-weight:300}
  .p5s-lead{font-size:16px;line-height:22.4px;font-weight:300;color:var(--p5-sec)}
  button.p5s-btn{padding:0;background:none;font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
  .p5s-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:224px;height:56px;border:1px solid var(--p5-sec);border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;line-height:16px;font-weight:300;color:var(--p5-sec);text-decoration:none}

  /* Testimoni: kartu 358×110, langkah 367 (Figma 1105,7). */
  .p5s-rev{height:166px}
  .p5s-rev__show{position:relative;margin:17px 16px 0}
  .p5s-rev__track{display:flex;gap:16px;height:110px;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;border-radius:16px}
  .p5s-rev__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .p5s-rev__track.is-dragging{scroll-snap-type:none;cursor:grabbing;user-select:none}
  .p5s-rev__card{position:relative;flex:0 0 100%;height:110px;border-radius:16px;background:#d7e6c6;scroll-snap-align:start;scroll-snap-stop:always}
  .p5s-rev__card img{-webkit-user-drag:none}
  .p5s-rev__photo{position:absolute;left:11px;top:14px;width:81px;height:81px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover}
  /* Baris kepala = flex, bukan 4 posisi absolut: "Terverifikasi" (ID) lebih panjang dari "Verified" dan dulu menabrak
     bintang. Jarak diambil dari Figma (nama 101→centang 155, centang→teks 4, teks→bintang 19), jadi EN tetap 1:1. */
  .p5s-rev__head{position:absolute;left:101px;top:14px;right:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;height:18px;white-space:nowrap}
  .p5s-rev__name{min-width:54px;padding-right:4px;font-size:16px;line-height:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--p5-ink)}
  .p5s-rev__check{flex:0 0 16px;height:16px}
  .p5s-rev__check svg{display:block}
  .p5s-rev__verified{margin-left:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:var(--p5-ink)}
  .p5s-rev__stars{flex:0 0 auto;margin-left:19px;width:56.8px;height:12.1px}
  .p5s-rev__quote{position:absolute;left:101px;top:40px;width:231px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:var(--p5-ink)}
  /* Titik persis Figma: baris 43×7 dengan tepi kanan 14 px dari tepi kartu, top 91. Area ketuk diperbesar via ::before. */
  .p5s-rev__dots{position:absolute;right:14px;top:91px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:2px}
  .p5s-rev__dot{position:relative;flex:none;width:7px;height:7px;margin:0;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--p5-ink);border-radius:50%;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .25s ease}
  .p5s-rev__dot::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-10px -1px}
  .p5s-rev__dot.is-on{background:var(--p5-ink)}
  .p5s-rev__dot:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--p5-ink);outline-offset:2px}

  /* Accordion (nilai komponen Figma sudah dalam px layar). */
  .p5s-acc-wrap{padding:0 16px 48px}
  .p5s-acc{padding:11px 22px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--p5-card)}
  .p5s-acc__item{border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5}
  .p5s-acc__item:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .p5s-acc__item summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:44px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:300;color:#6c7256}
  .p5s-acc__item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .p5s-acc__item summary img{width:12px;height:12px;transition:transform .2s}
  .p5s-acc__item[open]:not(.is-closing) summary img{transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .p5s-acc__body{overflow:hidden;padding:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;font-weight:300;color:#6c7256}
  .p5s-acc__body ul{list-style:disc;padding-left:21px}
  .p5s-acc__body :is(p,ul)+:is(p,ul){margin-top:24px}
  :lang(id) .p5s-acc__body :is(p,ul)+:is(p,ul){margin-top:6px}
  .p5s-acc__body strong{font-weight:700}

  /* Judul bagian (Frame 26 / Frame 33). */
  .p5s-head{padding:30px 16px 0}
  .p5s-head .p5s-h2{margin-top:20.8px}
  .p5s-head--expect{min-height:239px}
  .p5s-head--expect .p5s-lead{margin-top:13px}
  .p5s-head--how{min-height:342px}
  .p5s-head--how .p5s-h2{margin-top:20.9px}
  .p5s-head--how .p5s-lead{margin-top:19.9px}

  /* Timeline: kartu 358×722, isi 24 px dari tepi. */
  .p5s-tl-wrap{padding:23.5px 16px}
  .p5s-tl{min-height:722px;padding:24px 24px 0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--p5-card)}
  .p5s-tl__item{position:relative;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--p5-line)}
  .p5s-tl__item:first-child{border-top:0}
  .p5s-tl__title{font-size:20px;line-height:28px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.2px;color:var(--p5-ink);padding-right:calc(var(--pw,0px) + 8px)}
  .p5s-tl__pill{position:absolute;right:0;top:calc(12px + var(--pt,4px));height:20px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#bed4a2;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.07px;color:var(--p5-sec);white-space:nowrap;min-width:var(--pw,0)}
  .p5s-tl__desc{margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:19.6px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.07px;color:var(--p5-sec)}
  .p5s-tl__item--1{min-height:115px}.p5s-tl__item--1 .p5s-tl__pill{--pt:2px;--pw:56px;text-align:center}
  .p5s-tl__item--2{min-height:97px}.p5s-tl__item--2 .p5s-tl__pill{--pt:5.9px;--pw:91px;text-align:center}
